soketi-purealpha
================

This repository is a modified version of Soketi 1.6.1
(https://github.com/soketi/soketi, tag 1.6.1,
commit 5d188786beaf683aca2115a6247dcdc15c29ac77), licensed under the
GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE, unchanged from upstream).

Modification (2026-11, Pure Alpha):
- uWebSockets.js dependency pinned to v20.71.0
  (commit 9ec36de7709996c58dce03d63796216c90a17136) instead of v20.10.0,
  so the server runs on current Node.js LTS (24). Files changed: package.json,
  package-lock.json.
- New file src/uws-websocket.ts: type-only alias restoring the pre-20.11
  WebSocket typing (uWebSockets.js >= 20.11 made WebSocket generic); 16 files
  import WebSocket from it instead of 'uWebSockets.js'. No runtime code changes.
- docker/Dockerfile: the build recipe of the container image we run
  (Node 24, Debian trixie-slim, non-root user).

uWebSockets.js is a separate project (https://github.com/uNetworking/uWebSockets.js)
licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

This modified program is used to provide the Pure Alpha real-time service.
In accordance with section 13 of the AGPL-3.0, the complete corresponding
source code of the version we run is published here; IMAGES.md maps every
deployed image to the commit it was built from.

Note for secret scanners: the encryptionMasterKeyBase64 values in
tests/utils.ts are an upstream test fixture (added upstream in commit
9bb0576, 2021), used only by the test suite. They are not a secret and are left unchanged.
